2026-11-07T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2471) 'None of their models has been read yet; whether each is expressible on the temporal plan is a guess from the name alone, not yet a finding.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2471) 'What the temporal plan already carries
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Start, end and duration per step (an unspecified start and end are left out of a problem; a missing duration means the step is instantaneous), release times and deadlines, and a critical-path total. It carries no resources, so a model with a cumulative constraint cannot be expressed on it as it stands.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Acceptance
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2471) 'The same rule the planning puzzles used: valid and optimal, checked against MiniZinc itself, climbing from the smallest instance of a family up, never starting at the largest.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

